    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2739" root="بطح" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَطْحَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>stature</i> of a man [app. in a lying
posture]: as in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ بَطْحَةٌ رَجُلٍ</span> [<i>It is</i>
of <i>the stature of a man</i>]. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْنَهُمَا بَطْحَةٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَعِيدَةٌ</span> <i>Between them two is a far-extending distance</i> or <i>space</i> or <i>interval.</i> (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْطَحُ</span>.

